			"Message": "docs(Echo): Add project structure overview diagram\n\nAppend a new \"Project Structure Overview\" section to README.md detailing the directory layout of the Echo crate. Map key directories to their responsibilities: Source/Library.rs for exports, Queue for the crossbeam-based work-stealing deque, Scheduler for the worker pool and builder, and Task for definitions and effect integration.\n\nThis addition provides a visual map for contributors to navigate the high-performance scheduler codebase, complementing the recently rewritten architectural overview.\n\nReferences: 3be43fd59b542e5db7c01eebd6619ef6af2227e2",
